follow svg {\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 749px) {\n    .sea-collab {\n      padding: 20px;\n      gap: 16px;\n    }\n    .sea-collab__follow {\n      width: 100%;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n    .sea-collab__name {\n      font-size: 19px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n{%- comment -%}\n  Disclosure: the \"Paid partner\" badge carries the 4.H material connection (16 CFR Part 255).\n  Erica's own post carries #SeatopiaPartner. Confirm the relationship and keep the badge matched.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n<div class=\"sea-collab\">\n  <div class=\"sea-collab__avatar\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/casawellhealth.jpg\" alt=\"Erica Casavecchia\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sea-collab__body\">\n    <p class=\"sea-collab__eyebrow\">\n      <span>Guest recipe</span>\n      <span class=\"sea-collab__badge\">Paid partner</span>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"sea-collab__name\">Recipe by &#64;casawellhealth</p>\n    <p class=\"sea-collab__role\">Erica Casavecchia, MS, cooking with <a href=\"/products/atlantic-salmon-2x-6oz-portions\" title=\"Seatopia Atlantic Salmon\">our Atlantic Salmon</a></p>\n    <p class=\"sea-collab__cred\">Makes 2 bowls &middot; about 40 minutes &middot; gluten- and dairy-free</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <a class=\"sea-collab__follow\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/casawellhealth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\"></rect>\n      <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n      <circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"></circle>\n    </svg>\n    <span>Follow</span>\n  </a>\n</div>",
