          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>One of Erica&rsquo;s favorite fall recipes: a harvest quinoa bowl with honey cinnamon salmon and a bright turmeric tahini. Quinoa and lentils, roasted delicata squash, carrots and Tuscan kale, topped with roasted salmon and cashews. The warm, grounding spices make it a fall staple, and it is gluten- and dairy-free.</p><p>&ldquo;It&rsquo;s so hard to find good seafood in NYC, which is why I always have Seatopia stocked up in my freezer,&rdquo; Erica says. She uses our Atlantic Salmon, her favorite fish to cook with.</p>",
